    "detailed_description": "<strong>START AS A MINER, BECOME A FIGHTER</strong><br><br>Asteroidle is an idle game that allows you to asteroid mining. Discover technologies, buy and upgrade them. Travel at space continuously and face with new challenges.<br><br>\u2022 Limitless Offline Progress<br>\u2022 100 achievements (in game over 500+ achievements)<br>\u2022 Over 500+ upgrades<br>\u2022 20+ technologies<br>\u2022 15 different space objects<br>\u2022 2 Bosses<br>\u2022 Daily Quests and Challenges<br>\u2022 Travel between sectors, discover new galaxies<br>\u2022 Jump to dimensions, discover deep space<br>\u2022 Build your own Fleet<br>\u2022 Send your licensed pilots to missions<br>\u2022 Obtain new skills and surpass yourself<br>\u2022 Be the most dangerous person in space  (Leaderboard)<br>\u2022 2 mini games<br><br><strong>NOTE: Trailer is outdated, it belongs to first release. A lot of  changes happened and new features added since first release, I'll update it asap.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007080/extras/2959a4658c29d33db8288eea5be1ff12.poster.avif?t=1678550855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007080/extras/2959a4658c29d33db8288eea5be1ff12.webm?t=1678550855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007080/extras/2959a4658c29d33db8288eea5be1ff12.mp4?t=1678550855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>START AS A MINER, BECOME A FIGHTER</strong><br><br>Asteroidle is an idle game that allows you to asteroid mining. Discover technologies, buy and upgrade them. Travel at space continuously and face with new challenges.<br><br>\u2022 Limitless Offline Progress<br>\u2022 100 achievements (in game over 500+ achievements)<br>\u2022 Over 500+ upgrades<br>\u2022 20+ technologies<br>\u2022 15 different space objects<br>\u2022 2 Bosses<br>\u2022 Daily Quests and Challenges<br>\u2022 Travel between sectors, discover new galaxies<br>\u2022 Jump to dimensions, discover deep space<br>\u2022 Build your own Fleet<br>\u2022 Send your licensed pilots to missions<br>\u2022 Obtain new skills and surpass yourself<br>\u2022 Be the most dangerous person in space  (Leaderboard)<br>\u2022 2 mini games<br><br><strong>NOTE: Trailer is outdated, it belongs to first release. A lot of  changes happened and new features added since first release, I'll update it asap.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007080/extras/2959a4658c29d33db8288eea5be1ff12.poster.avif?t=1678550855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007080/extras/2959a4658c29d33db8288eea5be1ff12.webm?t=1678550855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007080/extras/2959a4658c29d33db8288eea5be1ff12.mp4?t=1678550855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
